@* shadcn's buttons are `cursor-default`, as a native <button> is — the pointer hand is for
   links, and using it on a button is a habit from the days when everything clickable was an <a>.
   Override it if your users expect otherwise; nothing in the library depends on it. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <Button>Default cursor</Button>
    <Button Class="cursor-pointer">Pointer</Button>
    <Button Variant="link" Href="/components/button">A link, which points</Button>
</div>
